description:
Welcome to design your dream mansion！👩‍🎨

As a great designer, you need to have professional knowledge and broad vision to go around the world to design different styles of mansion! From Paris to Tokyo, from New York to London, the world is in your design!😘
The mansion in the game is close to reality, matching different styles of furniture in your design. To get more design inspiration, you need to solve the match-3 puzzles. Trust me, the match-3 part is just as exciting as the building part!

-HOW TO PLAY-
●Swap to match 3 or more similar tiles in a line to crush them.
●Make a square of four to create the paper plane.
●Match 5 or more to create amazing boosters
●Find different kinds of powerful combos is the key to solve puzzles and beat the levels.
●Beat the levels to get more coins which are the necessary sources to buy decorations

-FEATURES-
●🆓Completely free game to play;
●🎨Traveling and designing all over the world;
●🎉Various interesting events in every week;
●😍Vivid character and attractive detective story;
●🏆Play with friends and share your works;

The application is designed for TV and STB (set-top boxes)

24TV — all TV channels in one application. Watch 24TV — modern interactive digital television.

More than 150 free TV channels, more than 400 TV channels in subscriptions, TV with an archive, as well as films, series, cartoons from popular online platforms such as Amediateka, START, viju, 24KINO, Nonfiction. 24TV is, first of all, free TV with a huge selection of federal and regional channels, such as Channel One, TNT, Match TV, NTV, TVC, VGTRK channels (Russia 1, Russia 24, Carousel), STS Kids and many others.

24TV is more than just an online cinema or a platform where the main TV channels are presented. This is an all-inclusive service: all TV channels in one app, access to popular programs, TV shows, news, sports broadcasts, classics and new releases. Install the 24TV app and watch movies, TV series and cartoons for children from the catalog of five popular online cinemas. And don't forget that some combo tariffs allow you to save significantly on subscriptions.

Want to watch your favorite TV series on Amediateka or dramas on viju? Easy! Watch at any time: at home, on the road, at the dacha. Missed an interesting program on TV? No problem! Use the TV with archive function - watch your favorite TV programs with pause and rewind. Cartoons for children, educational and entertainment programs - all this at a time convenient for you and your child. User-friendly interface and fast loading will make watching comfortable, and you will not miss anything.

With us you will find:
- Free TV - more than 150 TV channels;
— 400+ channels in the subscription;
— TV with an archive of up to 14 days;
— Movies, series, cartoons and shows for the whole family;
— Content of online cinemas Amediateka (series from leading world studios), viju (movies, series and cartoons for children), START (popular Russian series, Turkish hits and cartoons), 24KINO (dramas, Turkish films and films from the Plan B catalog), Nonfiction (smart documentaries);
— TV channels: Channel One, Match TV, TNT, TVC, VGTRK channels (Russia 1, Russia 24, Carousel), NTV, STS Kids and many others;
— Smart search and recommendations based on AI.

The application is intuitive, has a simple and convenient interface, fast navigation, adaptation for smartphones and tablets. Enjoy movies and free TV, subscribe to Amediateka, START or other online cinemas directly in the 24TV app - often it is also profitable due to regularly held promotions.

Download 24TV right now, get full access to the world of digital television and watch free TV without any conditions. And a trial subscription will give you the opportunity to watch TV channels with an archive of up to 14 days and open access to everything you love: movies, TV series, films, dramas and cartoons for children.

Art Master: Coloring Book is a new coloring puzzle game where you need to restore a picture from parts!

Start assembling the picture - initially the picture will be black and white. Look carefully at the pieces of the picture that will be displayed at the bottom of the screen and match them with the parts of the picture. Make a picture in full color and liven it up!

Why you'll love Art Master: Coloring Book:
- Unique pictures to color and collect;
- An excellent combination of two genres - puzzles and coloring books;
- Bright and colorful graphics
- Free hints;

So what are you waiting for? Download Art Master: Coloring Book and start color and liven up pictures!

Privacy Policy: https://aigames.ae/policy 
Terms of Use: https://azurgames.com/terms-of-use/

Линия Слова — это увлекательная словесная игра!
Собери слово из нескольких букв. Найди слова и разгадай кроссворд. Реши легкие кроссворды и переходи к более сложным!
- Интересно! Более 10 000 кроссвордов;
- Полезно! Развивай память, логику, расширяй словарный запас;
- Быстро! Каждый кроссворд займет пару минут;
- Просто! Соедини буквы пальцем и разгадай слово;
- Качественно! Игра сделана российскими разработчиками;
- Красиво! Игра приятна для глаз и позволяет расслабиться.

Если вы любите словесные игры, такие как кроссворды или сканворды — то эта игра точно для вас! Это не просто отличный способ развлечься, но и возможность потренировать свою память! 
Многие уже оценили эту замечательную игру и рекомендуют своим друзьям. Всё просто: соедини буквы, собери слова и открой словесный пазл. Используй подсказки или угадай слово, чтобы пройти сложный уровень. Знания алфавита не достаточно, проверь свой словарный запас. Игра улучшает грамотность, полезная головоломка для детей и взрослых!

Линия Слова это бесплатная игра, при этом в игре можно покупать монеты, которые позволяют упростить разгадывание особенно сложных кроссвордов.
Начни играть в Линию Слова и весело проведи время!
Политика конфиденциальности: https://www.evrikagames.com/privacy-policy/

Talking Tom is the cat making every day a fun adventure.

Players adopt this virtual pet, keep him happy and help him explore his world.

- Talking Tom can really talk 
- Fashion and furniture items to collect 
- Mini games add action, adventure and fun 
- Travel destinations are waiting to be explored 
