*** TRASMISSIONE STAZIONI RADIO IN DIRETTA ***  

Radio Italia è il miglior modo di ascoltare la radio a partire dall’iPhone o dall’iPad. 

Adesso può ascoltare le migliori stazioni radio italiane non soltanto quando si trova in Italia ma anche quando si trova all’estero: RTL, RADIO DEEJAY, RDS, RAI RADIO 1, RAI RADIO 2, RADIO ITALIA  etc.

L’applicazione Radio Italia le consente di: 
- Ascoltare le migliori stazioni radio di Italia; 
- Condividere su Facebook, Twitter,  via SMS o E-mail; 
- Ascoltare le radio via Air-Play (apparecchi bluetooth, per esempio);

NOTA: 
Alcune stazioni radio potranno restringere le loro trasmissioni, non è dunque garantito che lo streaming funzioni per tutte le stazioni radio. Questa applicazione è ottimizzata sia per la rete 3G sia per la Wi-Fi. 

Radio Italia le da la migliore esperienza di ascolto delle stazioni radio di Italia.

Preview your feed on Instagram with Inpreview: plan aesthetic grid layout, schedule posts, apply trendy filters. No login to Instagram!

NEW: Try our unique feature - Highlights Preview! Plan your highlights in the right order, preview them on your page and choose aesthetic highlight covers!

Fed up with using multiple tools to manage your Instagram page? Tired of guessing how new photos will fit in your feed? Care about making posts on time?

We’re continue developing a super convenient tool for resolve all your demands!
You're welclome to use our new feature "Log in without password" to display your IGTV and Reels posts.

With Inpreview you can do the following:
• Sync your Instagram feed;
• Plan and preview your highlights along with your posts;
• Instantly add AI-generated hashtags & captions;
• Upload images with no grid limits;
• Hide and unhide your posted Instagram images to see what your feed would look like;
• Rearrange and delete images;
• Apply stunning filters;
• Add captions under for your post;
• Schedule posts in several taps;
• Switch between multiple Instagram accounts;
• Save your perfectly created feed to camera roll and share it with friends;
• Export new images directly to Instagram;
• Enjoy Dark Mode.

Your drafts are saved automatically while you are planning your feed. You can reset it using "Revert Feed" option.

All accounts will start off with a FREE plan. You can upgrade to a PREMIUM plan any time.

FREE Plan:
• 1 Instagram account
• Hide posted images
• Export new images directly to Instagram.

PREMIUM Plan:
• Use multiple accounts 
• Hide / Unhide posted images
• Schedule posts 
• Add captions to your post
• Get rid of ads 
• Access all the new features
• All filters
• Choose from different subscription options for 1 month, 3 months or 12 months.

Payment will be charged to iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase. Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current period. Account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period, and identify the cost of the renewal. Subscriptions may be managed by the user and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to the user's Account Settings after purchase. Any unused portion of a free trial period, if offered, will be forfeited when the user purchases a subscription to that publication, where applicable.

