Screw Project is a challenging puzzle game. Enjoy the fun of playing the screw game and challenge awesome levels in Screw Project.

How to play the game?
First, clarify the level goals. Observe the color of the box above and click on the screws of the corresponding color until all the screws are unscrewed and collected in the box;
Secondly, the game requires a certain strategy and quick reaction. When unscrewing the screws on the glass, sometimes the screws will be blocked by the glass. The glass will automatically fall under the action of gravity. You need to predict the falling trajectory of the glass in advance and quickly click on the blocked screws, to avoid the glass not falling completely and blocking the screws again;
In addition, there are many kinds of screws in the game, including star-shaped screws and screws connected by ropes. Clicking on any of them will place them in the hole. If the screw hangs all over the hole, the level fails! Some levels may have fan screws, observe carefully!
Don't worry, the level has no time limit, and props are supported to assist in winning levels. Be bold and participate!

In this addictive screw game, you will find these fun features:
- Amazing boosters to help you along the way;
- Beautifully designed levels;
- Rich and interesting activities;
- Simple and relaxing screw game.

Screw Project has unique gameplay, each level designed delicately, providing an exciting gaming experience, start the game journey!

Build your fortune in this thrilling stock market game!

Step into the world of high-stakes investing and business strategy! Start with nothing and work your way up to become a top entrepreneur, growing your wealth. Every decision you make brings you closer to financial success, and with the right strategies, you can build an empire that thrives.

As you accumulate wealth, unlock the finer things. Purchase high-end sports cars, private jets, elegant yachts, and rare collectibles like priceless paintings and luxury watches. Your success isn’t just about numbers—it’s about status, prestige, and living life at the top!

- Buy low, sell high, and maximize your earnings in a dynamic economy;
- Grow your investments, manage multiple ventures, and watch your profits soar;
- Own premium cars, sleek airplanes, and elegant yachts to showcase your success;
- Build an exclusive collection of valuable paintings, watches, and more.
- Improve your financial expertise to make smarter, more profitable decisions;
- As your riches grow, carefully manage and reinvest to maintain unstoppable momentum.

The more you progress, the more complex the financial world becomes. Can you handle the pressure of being at the top? Your journey to wealth and prestige begins now!

Start tapping, investing, and rising to the top. Your financial empire awaits!

Welcome to Obby Memes: Grow Fruits!

Dive into this thrilling 3D obby adventure packed with unique fruits, epic challenges, and non-stop fun. Jump, climb, dash, and explore vibrant worlds as you tackle intense missions and battle powerful bosses!

Obby Memes: Grow Fruits is a fast-paced parkour game blending skillful platforming, fruit collection, and action-packed progression. Run, leap, and climb through dynamic levels, unlock fruits with super abilities, and conquer obstacles in a colorful 3D universe full of mini-games, upgrades, and boss fights. Perfect for fans of obby challenges, parkour simulators, and casual action games — enjoy skill-based gameplay, rewarding progression, and endless excitement.

This 3D obby delivers heart-pounding parkour trials, fruit-powered abilities, and immersive worlds. Master jumps and dodges, collect special fruits, and customize your character to dominate every level.

Game Features:

- Explore colorful landscapes brimming with thrilling obby challenges;
- Unlock fruits granting abilities like telekinesis, invisibility, and meteor showers—use them to smash obstacles;
- Hone your skills with jumps, dodges, and climbs across dynamic, obstacle-filled levels;
- Jump into dozens of quick challenges to keep the action fresh;
- Collect unique weapons and stylish skins to customize your character;
- Face mighty foes and unleash fruit powers in high-stakes showdowns.

Ready for an adrenaline-fueled obby journey? Collect fruits, master parkour, and conquer every challenge in this vibrant 3D world.

Download Obby Memes: Grow Fruits now on the App Store and start your ultimate adventure!

